Algites repository licensing summary
===================================

This file is generated from Algites licensing governance and the hierarchical license-usage.yml declarations in this repository.
Do not edit it manually. Run './gradlew rebuildAlgitesLicensing' after changing licensing declarations or definitions.

Repository root effective licensing
-----------------------------------
PRODUCT:
  - Apache License 2.0 (Apache-2.0)
DOCUMENTATION:
  - Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)

Full license texts
------------------
The LICENSES/ directory contains the canonical text of every license that is enabled anywhere in this repository.
LICENSES/ is managed by the Algites licensing tasks and must not be edited manually.

The machine-readable source of truth is the public/private governance licensing data together with repository-local licensing/license-definitions.yml and license-usage.yml files.
